  triage:title "runtime-observation-boundary allowed_paths still lists runtime_health.rs though the guarded tokens moved entirely to dispatch.rs" ;
  triage:description ".just/lint-config.toml's [runtime-observation-boundary].allowed_paths (~line 49) still lists crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health.rs, but grep confirms the file no longer contains any of the 3 guarded tokens -- they now live only in the sibling crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health/dispatch.rs, which is separately allowed. This is a stale, over-broad allowance left over from before the dispatch.rs module split. Found by ruthless-boundary-qa (RBQA-F003) during Phase AJ's final holistic gate review. QA source: PR #759." ;
